{
  "name": "TranscriptAnything — transcribe a link",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "link",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "apiBase",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://transcriptanything.zhst.app"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [20, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Input').item.json.apiBase }}/api/v1/transcriptions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ 'n8n-' + $execution.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ link: $('Input').item.json.link, options: { summary: { preset: 'bullets' } } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": false
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Create transcription",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [260, 0],
      "notes": "Credential: HTTP Header Auth, name Authorization, value Bearer tt_live_…"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 30,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [500, 0],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Input').item.json.apiBase }}/api/v1/transcriptions/{{ $('Create transcription').item.json.transcription.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Poll status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [740, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a1b2c3d4-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.transcription.status }}",
              "rightValue": "succeeded",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Done?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [980, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Input').item.json.apiBase }}/api/v1/transcriptions/{{ $json.transcription.id }}/result?format=srt",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-000a-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Download SRT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1240, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 20,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-000b-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Wait again",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1240, 120],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-000b-4000-8000-00000000000b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TranscriptAnything\n\n1. **Input** holds the public link.\n2. **Create transcription** posts it with an `Idempotency-Key`.\n3. **Wait** → **Poll status** until `succeeded` (replace polling with a `transcription.completed` webhook for production).\n4. **Download SRT** returns the file as text; switch `format` to `txt`, `vtt` or `json`.\n\nCredential: *HTTP Header Auth* with `Authorization: Bearer tt_live_…` (Developers → API keys).\n\nFree tier: media ≤ 3 minutes. Longer media needs credits and an account with headroom under the monthly cap.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-000c-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -360]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Input", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Input": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Create transcription", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Create transcription": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Wait", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Wait": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Poll status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Poll status": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Done?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Done?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Download SRT", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Wait again", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Wait again": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Poll status", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "transcriptanything-template"
  }
}
